## 📱 4. Social/Shareability — Pull Quotes, Share Triggers, Virality
**Score: 8.5/10**

Strong share triggers:
- "741,195 vehicles, 10 months, no fix" — extremely shareable headline format
- "~296,000 will never be fixed" — sticky number
